---
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>터미널 아카데미 — TERMINAL ACADEMY</title>
  <meta name="description" content="터미널 아카데미 · 강남 코딩학원 · 부트캠프 / 백엔드 / 알고리즘 / 임베디드. 올드스쿨 해커 정신으로 가르칩니다." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&family=VT323&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #001008;
      --bg-deep: #000704;
      --green: #33ff66;
      --green-dim: #1f9c3f;
      --green-faint: #0c4a1f;
      --green-glow: rgba(51, 255, 102, 0.55);
      --amber: #ffb000;
      --scan: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.30);
      --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'Courier New', monospace;
      --crt: 'VT323', 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--green);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      text-shadow: 0 0 4px var(--green-glow);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: none;
    }

    /* CRT curvature + vignette + global glow */
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 9000;
      pointer-events: none;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 130% at 50% 50%, transparent 55%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55) 100%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 100% at 50% 50%, rgba(51,255,102,0.04), transparent 60%);
    }

    /* Scanlines */
    body::after {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 9001;
      pointer-events: none;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        to bottom,
        transparent 0,
        transparent 2px,
        var(--scan) 3px,
        var(--scan) 3px
      );
      background-size: 100% 4px;
      opacity: 0.55;
      animation: scanmove 8s linear infinite;
    }

    @keyframes scanmove {
      0% { background-position: 0 0; }
      100% { background-position: 0 100px; }
    }

    @keyframes flicker {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
      4% { opacity: 0.86; }
      6% { opacity: 1; }
      52% { opacity: 0.92; }
      54% { opacity: 1; }
    }

    @keyframes blink {
      0%, 49% { opacity: 1; }
      50%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
    }

    @keyframes typing-line {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .wrap {
      max-width: 1040px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      animation: flicker 6s infinite;
    }

    .cursor {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 0.62em;
      height: 1.05em;
      background: var(--green);
      vertical-align: -0.16em;
      margin-left: 2px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--green-glow);
      animation: blink 1.05s step-end infinite;
    }

    .prompt { color: var(--amber); text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(255,176,0,0.5); }
    .dim { color: var(--green-dim); text-shadow: none; }
    .amber { color: var(--amber); text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(255,176,0,0.5); }

    a { color: var(--green); }

    /* ===== Section frame: ASCII box ===== */
    section { padding: 46px 0; }

    .section-tag {
      font-family: var(--crt);
      font-size: 22px;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--green-dim);
      text-shadow: none;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .ascii-box {
      border: 1px solid var(--green-faint);
      position: relative;
      padding: 26px 28px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(51,255,102,0.025), transparent 40%);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(51,255,102,0.04);
    }
    .ascii-box::before {
      content: attr(data-label);
      position: absolute;
      top: -0.8em;
      left: 18px;
      background: var(--bg);
      padding: 0 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--green-dim);
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-shadow: none;
    }

    /* ===== HERO / boot ===== */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding-top: 64px;
      padding-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .boot {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: var(--green-dim);
      text-shadow: none;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
    }
    .boot .line {
      opacity: 0;
      animation: typing-line 0.25s ease forwards;
    }
    .boot .ok { color: var(--green); text-shadow: 0 0 4px var(--green-glow); }

    .hero-title {
      font-family: var(--crt);
      font-size: clamp(48px, 13vw, 132px);
      line-height: 0.92;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      color: var(--green);
      text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--green-glow), 0 0 28px rgba(51,255,102,0.3);
      margin: 6px 0 4px;
    }
    .hero-sub {
      font-family: var(--crt);
      font-size: clamp(20px, 4vw, 34px);
      color: var(--amber);
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,176,0,0.4);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .hero-desc {
      max-width: 620px;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--green-dim);
      text-shadow: none;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .hero-cta {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--green);
      color: var(--green);
      padding: 12px 22px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      transition: all 0.18s;
    }
    .hero-cta:hover {
      background: var(--green);
      color: var(--bg-deep);
      text-shadow: none;
      box-shadow: 0 0 22px var(--green-glow);
    }

    .stats {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 32px;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    .stat .num {
      font-family: var(--crt);
      font-size: 40px;
      color: var(--green);
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--green-glow);
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .stat .lbl { font-size: 12px; color: var(--green-dim); text-shadow: none; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }

    /* ===== Curriculum / ls ===== */
    .ls-head {
      color: var(--green-dim);
      text-shadow: none;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--green-faint);
      padding-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .course {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr auto;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: baseline;
      padding: 14px 6px;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green-faint);
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    .course:hover { background: rgba(51,255,102,0.06); }
    .course .perm { color: var(--green-dim); text-shadow: none; font-size: 13px; }
    .course .cname {
      font-size: 17px;
      color: var(--green);
    }
    .course .cname .ext { color: var(--amber); text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(255,176,0,0.4); }
    .course .cdesc { display: block; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--green-dim); text-shadow: none; margin-top: 4px; }
    .course .cmeta { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--green-dim); text-shadow: none; text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
    .course .cmeta b { color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; }

    /* ===== Tuition table ===== */
    .pre-table {
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      white-space: pre;
      overflow-x: auto;
      color: var(--green);
    }
    .tuition-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .tcard {
      border: 1px solid var(--green-faint);
      padding: 22px 20px;
      position: relative;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(51,255,102,0.03), transparent);
      transition: border-color 0.18s, box-shadow 0.18s;
    }
    .tcard:hover { border-color: var(--green); box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(51,255,102,0.12); }
    .tcard.featured { border-color: var(--amber); }
    .tcard.featured::after {
      content: "[ 추천 ]";
      position: absolute; top: -0.7em; right: 16px;
      background: var(--bg); padding: 0 8px;
      font-size: 11px; color: var(--amber); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-shadow: none;
    }
    .tcard h3 { font-family: var(--crt); font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .tcard .price { font-family: var(--crt); font-size: 38px; color: var(--amber); text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,176,0,0.35); line-height: 1.1; }
    .tcard .price small { font-size: 14px; color: var(--green-dim); text-shadow: none; }
    .tcard ul { list-style: none; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; }
    .tcard li { padding: 5px 0; color: var(--green-dim); text-shadow: none; }
    .tcard li::before { content: "> "; color: var(--green); text-shadow: 0 0 4px var(--green-glow); }

    /* ===== Instructors ===== */
    .inst-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
    .inst {
      border: 1px solid var(--green-faint);
      padding: 20px 22px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    .inst:hover { background: rgba(51,255,102,0.05); }
    .avatar {
      font-family: var(--crt);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.05;
      white-space: pre;
      color: var(--green);
      text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--green-glow);
      border: 1px solid var(--green-faint);
      padding: 6px 8px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .inst .iname { font-size: 17px; color: var(--green); }
    .inst .irole { font-size: 12px; color: var(--amber); text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(255,176,0,0.4); letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin: 3px 0 8px; }
    .inst .ibio { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--green-dim); text-shadow: none; }
    .inst .itags { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--green-dim); text-shadow: none; }

    /* ===== Contact ===== */
    .term-block {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }
    .term-block .row { display: block; }
    .term-block .out { color: var(--green-dim); text-shadow: none; padding-left: 1.2em; }
    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 26px;
    }
    .cbox { border: 1px solid var(--green-faint); padding: 16px 18px; }
    .cbox .ck { font-size: 11px; color: var(--green-dim); text-shadow: none; letter-spacing: 0.14em; }
    .cbox .cv { font-size: 16px; color: var(--green); margin-top: 4px; }
    .cbox .cv.am { color: var(--amber); text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(255,176,0,0.4); }

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--green-faint);
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 30px 0 60px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--green-dim);
      text-shadow: none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      body { font-size: 14px; }
      .course { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
      .course .perm { display: none; }
      .course .cmeta { text-align: left; }
      .tuition-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .inst-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .stats { gap: 22px; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .wrap, body::after { animation: none !important; }
      .cursor { animation: none; opacity: 1; }
      .boot .line { opacity: 1; animation: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- 데모바 -->
  <div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
    <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
    <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 23 · 터미널 아카데미 — 그린 CRT 터미널 스타일</span>
    <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
  </div>
  <div style="height:40px;"></div>

  <div class="wrap">

    <!-- ===== HERO / BOOT ===== -->
    <section class="hero" id="top">
      <div class="boot" aria-hidden="true">
<span class="line" style="animation-delay:.05s">TERMINAL ACADEMY BIOS v3.14 ... <span class="ok">OK</span></span>
<span class="line" style="animation-delay:.30s">Loading kernel /boot/teaching.img ... <span class="ok">OK</span></span>
<span class="line" style="animation-delay:.55s">Mounting /dev/students ... 1,284 nodes <span class="ok">OK</span></span>
<span class="line" style="animation-delay:.80s">Initializing instructors[8] ... <span class="ok">OK</span></span>
<span class="line" style="animation-delay:1.05s">net: 강남 캠퍼스 link up @ 강남대로 ... <span class="ok">OK</span></span>
<span class="line" style="animation-delay:1.30s">Starting session ...</span>
      </div>

      <div><span class="prompt">root@terminal-academy</span><span class="dim">:</span><span class="amber">~</span><span class="dim">#</span> ./run --mission</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">TERMINAL<br />ACADEMY</h1>
      <div class="hero-sub">$ 코드는 손으로 짠다_ <span class="cursor"></span></div>
      <p class="hero-desc">
        강남 한복판, 화면 가득 초록 글자. 우리는 IDE 자동완성에 기대지 않고
        <span class="amber">기본기부터 손으로</span> 짭니다. 부트캠프 · 백엔드 · 알고리즘 · 임베디드 —
        4개월 뒤, 당신은 터미널만으로 빌드하고 배포할 수 있습니다.
      </p>
      <a class="hero-cta" href="#contact">[ ENTER ] 상담 신청 &gt;</a>

      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat"><div class="num">1,284</div><div class="lbl">// 누적 수료생</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="num">88%</div><div class="lbl">// 6개월 내 취업률</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="num">8</div><div class="lbl">// 현업 멘토 강사</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="num">24/7</div><div class="lbl">// 실습실 개방</div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== CURRICULUM / ls ===== -->
    <section id="curriculum">
      <div class="section-tag">// 02 · CURRICULUM</div>
      <div class="ascii-box" data-label="DIRECTORY">
        <div><span class="prompt">student@academy</span><span class="dim">:</span><span class="amber">~/courses</span><span class="dim">$</span> ls -al --courses</div>
        <div class="ls-head dim">total 4 · drwxr-xr-x · 4 courses · 강남 캠퍼스</div>

        <div class="course">
          <span class="perm">-rwxr--r--</span>
          <span>
            <span class="cname">bootcamp<span class="ext">.full</span></span>
            <span class="cdesc">제로베이스 → 풀스택. HTML/CSS, JS, React, Node, DB, 배포까지 한 번에.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="cmeta"><b>16주</b> · 주 5일<br />평일 10:00–18:00</span>
        </div>

        <div class="course">
          <span class="perm">-rwxr-x--x</span>
          <span>
            <span class="cname">backend<span class="ext">.server</span></span>
            <span class="cdesc">Linux/Docker, Spring·Express, RESTful API, PostgreSQL, CI/CD 실전.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="cmeta"><b>12주</b> · 주 3일<br />화·목·토 19:00–22:00</span>
        </div>

        <div class="course">
          <span class="perm">-rwxr--r--</span>
          <span>
            <span class="cname">algorithm<span class="ext">.dsa</span></span>
            <span class="cdesc">자료구조·알고리즘 집중. 코딩테스트 / SW 역량테스트 대비 트랙.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="cmeta"><b>8주</b> · 주 2일<br />월·수 19:30–22:00</span>
        </div>

        <div class="course">
          <span class="perm">-rwx------</span>
          <span>
            <span class="cname">embedded<span class="ext">.iot</span></span>
            <span class="cdesc">C/펌웨어, RTOS, 라즈베리파이·STM32 핸즈온. 하드웨어 해커 트랙.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="cmeta"><b>10주</b> · 주 2일<br />토·일 13:00–17:00</span>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:16px"><span class="prompt">student@academy</span><span class="dim">:</span><span class="amber">~/courses</span><span class="dim">$</span> <span class="cursor"></span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== TUITION ===== -->
    <section id="tuition">
      <div class="section-tag">// 03 · TUITION</div>
      <div class="ascii-box" data-label="PRICING">
        <div style="margin-bottom:18px"><span class="prompt">student@academy</span><span class="dim">:</span><span class="amber">~</span><span class="dim">$</span> cat tuition.cfg <span class="dim"># 부가세 포함 · 교재비 별도</span></div>

        <div class="tuition-grid">
          <div class="tcard">
            <h3>NIGHT</h3>
            <div class="price">₩890,000<br /><small>/ 8주 과정</small></div>
            <ul>
              <li>알고리즘 / 단과 트랙</li>
              <li>주 2회 야간반</li>
              <li>실습실 24시간 개방</li>
              <li>온라인 복습 영상</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tcard featured">
            <h3>FULL</h3>
            <div class="price">₩3,900,000<br /><small>/ 16주 부트캠프</small></div>
            <ul>
              <li>풀스택 전 과정 포함</li>
              <li>1:1 멘토링 주 1회</li>
              <li>실전 팀 프로젝트 2건</li>
              <li>취업 연계 · 이력서 클리닉</li>
              <li>국비지원 / 분할납부 가능</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tcard">
            <h3>PRO</h3>
            <div class="price">₩2,400,000<br /><small>/ 12주 백엔드</small></div>
            <ul>
              <li>서버·인프라 심화 트랙</li>
              <li>Docker / CI·CD 실습</li>
              <li>코드리뷰 무제한</li>
              <li>현직자 모의면접</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:22px" class="dim">
          <div class="pre-table">┌────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┐
│ 결제수단    │ 분할         │ 비고          │
├────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤
│ 카드        │ 최대 12개월  │ 무이자 6개월  │
│ 국비지원    │ 자부담 0~20% │ 내일배움카드  │
│ 현금        │ 일시납       │ 5% 할인       │
└────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────┘</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== INSTRUCTORS ===== -->
    <section id="instructors">
      <div class="section-tag">// 04 · INSTRUCTORS</div>
      <div class="ascii-box" data-label="WHOAMI">
        <div style="margin-bottom:18px"><span class="prompt">guest@academy</span><span class="dim">:</span><span class="amber">~</span><span class="dim">$</span> ps aux | grep instructor</div>

        <div class="inst-grid">
          <div class="inst">
            <div class="avatar">┌──┐
│oo│
│ ◡│
└──┘</div>
            <div>
              <div class="iname">정 우진</div>
              <div class="irole">CHIEF / 백엔드·인프라</div>
              <div class="ibio">전 카카오 서버 개발 9년. 트래픽 폭주를 라면 끓이듯 다루는 사람. "장애는 새벽에 온다"가 좌우명.</div>
              <div class="itags">[ Java ] [ Spring ] [ Kubernetes ] [ AWS ]</div>
            </div>
